  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/nh-rsa-data/blob/96bd0a247d4463e2ae692310c0fdd17ec563a46c/rsa_html/XXI/269/269-1.htm",
  "statuteText": "269:1 Definition. –\n\nIn this chapter, \"electric personal assistive mobility device\" or \"EPAMD\" shall mean a self-propelled device, regardless of the number of wheels, designed to transport only one person, solely powered by an electric propulsion system, with a maximum speed of less than 20 miles per hour."
